
[l_english.FOCUS_C12_SEND_SECRET_VOLUNTEERS]
Send Secret Volunteers

[l_english.FOCUS_C12_SEND_SECRET_VOLUNTEERS_desc]
Although the Rock Farm is still nominally under the Empire’s jurisdiction, the atrocities committed by the Empire have long severed the final thread of mutual benefit that once bound them.\nHowever, the vast distance between the farm and the resistance forces makes direct contact nearly impossible.\nThus, a secret team, carefully chosen by Maud Pie, is now fully prepared for departure.\nThey will pass through the Forbidden Jungle — all for one purpose: to let the resistance know that, when the moment comes, every unyielding stone will rise and stand behind them.

[l_english.FOCUS_C12_SEND_SECRET_VOLUNTEERS_TOOLTIP]
§R The Resistance organization will receive assistance from our volunteer soldiers and establish communication channels §!

[l_simp_chinese.FOCUS_C12_SEND_SECRET_VOLUNTEERS]
暗中输送志愿者

[l_simp_chinese.FOCUS_C12_SEND_SECRET_VOLUNTEERS_desc]
目前采石农场名义上依旧隶属于帝国，但帝国的暴行早已切断了最后那一缕利益上的纽带。然而，农场与抵抗组织之间的遥远距离，使得双方难以直接往来，因此，一支由石灰派精心挑选的秘密队伍正整装待发。借道禁区丛林，只为告诉抵抗组织，当那一刻来临，一块块顽石将站在他们的身后。

[l_simp_chinese.FOCUS_C12_SEND_SECRET_VOLUNTEERS_TOOLTIP]
§R抵抗组织会收到我们志愿士兵的援助，并建立沟通渠道§!
